flowchart TB
  accTitle: Recovery follows durable ownership
  accDescr: New work is bounded by admission while accepted work retains its outbox, leases and durable outcome. Fan-out failure never deletes outcomes; replay or a fresh snapshot recovers the browser.
  N[New logical submission] --> A{Fresh supply and budgets?}
  A -->|No| REJECT[429 or 503 + bounded retry guidance]
  A -->|Yes| ACCEPT[2 Stored original + queued job + outbox]
  ACCEPT --> B{3 Broker confirms?}
  B -->|No / ambiguous| O[Keep intent; confirmed publication may repeat]
  O --> B
  B -->|Yes| W[4–5 Worker lease and source safety]
  W -->|Interrupted| L[Lease / deadline reconciliation; bounded retry]
  L --> W
  W -->|Terminal| SAVE[6 Outcome + notice + durable revision]
  SAVE --> F{7b Fan-out available?}
  F -->|No| D[Keep unpublished intent; retry]
  D --> F
  F -->|Yes| G[7c SSE gateway reads durable gap]
  G -->|Disconnected or old cursor| S[Subscribe then replay or reset snapshot]
  S --> READ[7d Authorized REST reads]
  G --> READ
  READ --> UI[Result on same processing route; inbox elsewhere]
